  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRD Prog.Support to Human Rights Defenders - Support to Human Rights Defenders</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CRD Prog.Support to Human Rights Defenders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civil Rights Defenders (CRD) har ans&#xf6;kt hos Sida om 15 543 500 SEK f&#xf6;r att under 2016-2018 genomf&#xf6;ra projektet &quot;Improving Access to Information and Equality in Albania&quot;. Insatsen &#xe4;mnar &#xf6;ka tillg&#xe5;ngen till r&#xe4;ttvisa och &#xf6;ka respekten f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter genom att 1) St&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nniskors f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att h&#xe4;vda sina m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter 2) Uppmuntra staten att ta ansvar f&#xf6;r uppfyllelsen av de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna och 3) St&#xe4;rka albanska m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare. 

Projektet bygger p&#xe5; l&#xe4;rdomar och erfarenheter fr&#xe5;n liknande projekt som har genomf&#xf6;rts av CRD i Albanien med finansiering fr&#xe5;n Sida.

Runt 47% av det totala anslaget kommer &#xf6;verf&#xf6;ras till tredje parter som i det h&#xe4;r fallet &#xe4;r albanska m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsorganisationer som har valts ut som samarbetsparter av CRD.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is a continuation of cooperation with Civil Rights   Defenders in Albania. The support is envisaged for a three year       period and is about improving respect for people&apos;s rights through     support to Human Rights Defenders.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this intervention is to improve people&apos;s access to freedom and justice through increased respect for their civil and political rights.The intervention has three main outcomes: - People are empowered to claim their human rights- States take better responsibility for the fulfilment of human rights- Local human rights defenders are empowered</narrative>
  </description>
